%% Closed-loop powder + open-loop timed water (Phase 1)
%% Render with Mermaid

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as CLI / local API
  participant Orch as DispenseCycle
  participant Scale as HX711 Scale
  participant Auger as Auger + Stepper
  participant Vibe as Vibration pulses
  participant Pump as Water Pump timed

  User->>UI: Recipe / target grams + ml
  UI->>Orch: run_recipe / dose

  Note over Orch,Scale: Preflight (cup / interlocks)
  Orch->>Orch: cup present? e-stop clear?
  alt No cup or halt
    Orch-->>UI: ABORT (NO_CUP / ESTOP)
  end
  Orch->>Scale: tare()
  Scale-->>Orch: zero_ok

  Note over Orch,Vibe: Powder closed loop
  loop Until powder near target
    Orch->>Auger: short burst
    Orch->>Vibe: short pulse (not continuous)
    Auger-->>Orch: done
    Orch->>Scale: settle_read
    Scale-->>Orch: current_mass
    Orch->>Orch: adapt burst size
    alt No progress (jam window)
      Orch->>Auger: reverse-auger clear
      Orch->>Orch: if still no progress → JAM / EMPTY
    end
  end

  Orch->>Scale: final_verify after settle
  Scale-->>Orch: powder_final
  alt |powder_final - target| > tolerance
    Orch-->>UI: FAIL / WARN (ACCURACY)
  end

  Note over Orch,Pump: Water open-loop timed
  Orch->>Pump: run t = V / ml_per_second
  Pump-->>Orch: complete (estimated volume)
  Note over Orch,Pump: Verify offline with graduated cylinder when calibrating
  alt Low water / pump error
    Orch-->>UI: ABORT (LOW_WATER / PUMP)
  end

  Note over Orch: mix_delay = sleep only (no mixer motor)
  Orch->>Orch: sleep(mix_delay_seconds)

  Orch-->>UI: COMPLETE + log (powder_g, water_ml, messages)
  UI-->>User: Status / log (drink quality not guaranteed)
